Practical Commands

The following commands were used during the practical lab.

1. Check Network Interfaces

# Check network interfaces
ip addr

2. Check Routing Table

# Check routing table
ip route

3. Check Default Gateway

# Check default gateway
ip route | grep default

4. Check DNS Configuration

# Check DNS configuration
cat /etc/resolv.conf

5. Test Connectivity to Google DNS

# Test connectivity to Google DNS
ping -c 4 8.8.8.8

6. Test Connectivity to Cloudflare DNS

# Test connectivity to Cloudflare DNS
ping -c 4 1.1.1.1

7. Test HTTP/HTTPS Connectivity

# Test HTTP/HTTPS connectivity
curl -I https://google.com

